# =========================================================================
# GITIGNORE - AI for BI Data Scientist Agent
# Comprehensive protection keeping the repository clean of:
# - Secrets, keys, tokens and environment variables
# - Python bytecode, virtual environments, caches and eggs
# - Testing, coverage, junit reports and mock artifacts
# - Frontend Next.js build artifacts, node_modules and bundler caches
# - Databases, SQLite instances, warehouses, journals and locks
# - Runtime generated vector stores, LanceDB tables, and BM25 indices
# - Temporary scratch scripts and editor backups
# - ML model weights, FastEmbed/HuggingFace caches and pickles
# - Operational logs, traces, process IDs and locks
# - Operating system metadata, IDE settings and AI agent state
# =========================================================================

# --- 1. Secrets, Credentials, Tokens & Local Environment ---
